.claude/settings.json
.claude/launch.json
.DS_Store
# internal/ stays out of git — design notes and working plans are the author's local
# scratch. ONE exception: the method rationale record, which holds the incident evidence
# behind each method rule. tests/test_method_rationale.py pairs the two, so the record has to be
# COMMITTABLE: a committed test cannot depend on a file git refuses to track. NOTE it is only safe
# once actually committed — while untracked-and-un-ignored, a plain `git clean -d` removes it. So
# commit it in the same commit as the method docs.
internal/*
!internal/docs/
internal/docs/*
!internal/docs/method-rationale.md
.firecrawl/
__pycache__/
.playwright-mcp/
# Screenshots dropped at the repo root while driving a browser. `.playwright-mcp/` above catches the
# ones the tool files itself, but a named screenshot lands here, and a broad `git add -A` swept one
# into a commit. Root only (a leading slash), so tracked art like assets/viewer.png is untouched.
/*.png
# …and the folder they get filed into when a session keeps a set to compare across runs. Same rule
# as the loose ones: they are how a change was checked, not part of the product.
.shots/
tools/coyomap/viewer/build/
map-backups/
.venv/
build/
dist/
*.egg-info/
